rfall is created by the Pundalu Oya river which is a tributary of Kotmale Oya.", "extract_html": "<p><b>Dunsinane Falls</b> is a waterfall in Nuwara Eliya District of Sri Lanka. It is situated in Pundaluoya village and between the Tea estates known as Dunsinane and Sheen. Therefore sometimes this falls is called as <i>Dunsinane Sheen falls</i>. The waterfall is created by the Pundalu Oya river which is a tributary of Kotmale Oya.</p>"}